# Hashed byte-for-byte (manifest sha256, Rust test vectors): never convert line endings.
datasets/** -text
crates/pzm-integrity/vectors/** -text
# Node scripts with a shebang: a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf on Windows) breaks the
# shebang under vite/vitest SSR ("Invalid or unexpected token"). Keep them LF everywhere.
*.mjs text eol=lf
